    en: "The writer brought home a puppy found outside, has been looking after it for months, and says “강아지와 헤어지기 싫습니다” (I don't want to part with it) — ④. ① The owner hasn't turned up. ② The writer found the puppy rather than losing it. ③ On the contrary, the writer doesn't want to give it up.",
